{"about_the_game":"Queen of Seas is a casual platformer game. The game theme is about Yemanj\u00e1, the Queen of Seas in afro-brazilian religion. The underwater enviroment is so beautiful such as the original background story. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a fisherman\u2019s son, that need to dive deep and deliver offerings to the Queen of Seas proof his family\u2019s faith.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayer must avoid all deep sea danger and collect coins to upgrade his scuba dive suit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThree upgrades are avaiable (3 levels each):<br />\r\nHelmet \u2013 makes you move faster.<br />\r\nChest \u2013 makes you more resistant to shark and jellyfish attacks.<br />\r\nLegs \u2013 makes you jump heigher.<br />\r\nWith more upgrades player can walk longer distances and (maybe) reach the Queen of Seas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayer can get some extra coins by achievements unlocking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQueen of Seas theme is inspired by real afro-brazilian religion and have a full original storytelling made by award winner writer.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"96ff3827b83f90cb1b628fd6a0ca1ac62b0f594a.jpg","localized_name":"What a Whale!!","name":"What a Whale!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/575580/96ff3827b83f90cb1b628fd6a0ca1ac62b0f594a.jpg"},{"icon":"11d9706f00c1b7f0f90438d9040813c2533599c9.jpg","localized_name":"Wow! Another Whale!!","name":"Wow! Another Whale!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/575580/11d9706f00c1b7f0f90438d9040813c2533599c9.jpg"},{"icon":"16d2840ac39e47cb38c4ee67281df844bcbfa1cf.jpg","localized_name":"How is That Even Possible?","name":"How is That Even Possible?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/575580/16d2840ac39e47cb38c4ee67281df844bcbfa1cf.jpg"},{"icon":"4853f68505a3a8168dad830278b46e369bb64d54.jpg","localized_name":"Shark Food","name":"Shark Food","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam